{{Disadvantages|}}

==Acquisition==
Praedos' main blueprint is purchased from [[Cavalero]] of [[The Holdfasts]] at '''Rank 4 - Seraph''' for {{sc|9,000}} Standing. The blueprint can be [[Trading|traded]].
{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon|name=Praedos}}

==Notes==
*If an Incarnon Form is successfully achieved, Praedos will depict itself exuding a turquoise aura. The skin in this state is shared across all tonfas skins.

